      "message": "Some general issues and things that need to be improved with this:\n\n* It doesn\u0027t provide source references to `cryptoc`, since we invoke `cryptoc`\u0027s Makefile to output targets to our build directory\n* We don\u0027t capture utils, tests, or other compilations\n\n\nThese can definitely be added, but are not included in this implementation.",
