      "message": "Nice. I think I have solutions in place for all of these now.\n\n* I fixed the faulty \"directory\" entry to use EXTERNAL_TRUNK_PATH if available.\n* The two absolute -I include paths you mentioned are caused by the cryptoc config. CL crrev.com/c/3855590 and crrev.com/c/3855591 should fix them.\n* Those two compiler args `-mno-sched-prolog` and `-fconserve-stack` are gcc specific. Since I couldn\u0027t get the EC clang compilation mode to work, I simply added a filter to remove these args. \n\nLet me know how this work!",
